<title>POLAND: PPAB sees PLN 12.4 mln net in 1997.</title>
<headline>PPAB sees PLN 12.4 mln net in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The First Polish American Bank (PPAB) expects to net 12.4 million zlotys in 1997 against an expected profit of more than 8.8 million zlotys this year, the bank said in a Friday statement.</p>
<p>In the first 11 months of this year PPAB reported a net profit of 7.8 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
